# Power BI Dashboard Project

This project showcases the use of **Microsoft Power BI** to transform raw data into meaningful business insights through interactive dashboards and visual analytics. It demonstrates the complete Business Intelligence workflow, including data cleaning, transformation, modeling, visualization, and dashboard design to support data-driven decision-making.

---

## Features

### Data Cleaning & Transformation

* Cleaned and transformed raw datasets using **Power Query**.
* Handled missing values, corrected data types, and created calculated columns.
* Built relationships between multiple tables to create a robust data model.

### Exploratory Data Analysis

* Developed **DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)** measures to calculate key performance indicators (KPIs).
* Created custom metrics such as:

  * Wage-to-Overall Rating Ratio
  * Age Groups
  * Performance Classes
* Applied filters and segmentation to uncover meaningful trends and patterns.

### Interactive Visualizations

* Designed interactive visualizations using:

  * Bar Charts
  * Column Charts
  * Line Charts
  * Pie Charts
  * KPI Cards
* Added dynamic slicers for real-time filtering.
* Implemented drill-through pages for detailed player-level analysis.

### Dashboard Design

* Built a professional single-page executive dashboard.
* Used a clean, consistent color palette for improved readability.
* Organized visuals to highlight comparisons, trends, and performance insights.

---

## Tools & Technologies

* Microsoft Power BI
* Power Query (ETL – Extract, Transform, Load)
* DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
* Data Modeling (Relationships, Hierarchies, Calculated Columns)
* Dashboard Design & Data Visualization

