## Key Insights

* Identified the highest-rated players and clubs based on overall performance.
* Analyzed **wage-to-performance ratios** to evaluate player value.
* Explored player age distribution to understand talent demographics.
* Classified players into performance categories for easier comparison.
* Enabled interactive filtering to uncover trends across multiple dimensions.

